          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "промежуток (promezhútok) is built on промеж \"between\", a cousin of между; both go back to the Slavic root of межа \"a boundary strip\", Proto-Slavic medja (EtymDB). EtymDB lists no parent for промежуток (promezhútok)."
